# Testing Rules

- Prefer tests around business rules and critical workflows.
- Every important inventory mutation should have regression coverage.
- Sales should verify stock reduction.
- Purchases should verify stock increase.
- Stock adjustments/transfers should be traceable.
- Credit sales should update customer receivables correctly.
- Tests should use realistic domain scenarios, not only trivial getters/setters.
- When fixing a bug, add a regression test when practical.
